# Python bytecode. `scripts/__pycache__/preflight.cpython-312.pyc` reached
# main in e685c06 and preflight named it immediately -- the manifest check
# earning its keep against a `git add -A`, which is how two stray files got
# tracked today. Ignored so the next one cannot: a check that catches a
# mistake is worth less than a rule that prevents it, when the rule is free.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
